{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Is Your Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the force of gravity to aim your shots around planets and asteroids. Destructible planets take damage as your missiles crash into them. Take turns battling until only one team remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/af79ab78b9e0a11f092ad558603d2a36.poster.avif?t=1770389064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/af79ab78b9e0a11f092ad558603d2a36.webm?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/af79ab78b9e0a11f092ad558603d2a36.mp4?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Your Enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a variety of different teams in the single player campaign, each with their own personality, story and motives. Battle against teams around the world in online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/4bbd28b3c1648c59e0e3d43e3b8706d8.poster.avif?t=1770389064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/4bbd28b3c1648c59e0e3d43e3b8706d8.webm?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/4bbd28b3c1648c59e0e3d43e3b8706d8.mp4?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blast Off On A Stellar Journey Across the Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is really big. Discover and destroy on a planetary scale. Travel across the galaxy map or generate your own maps for multiplayer. Infinite possibilities in an infinitely expanding universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/5a62aa34eca9803c9a4981725a214569.poster.avif?t=1770389064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/5a62aa34eca9803c9a4981725a214569.webm?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/5a62aa34eca9803c9a4981725a214569.mp4?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Kitted Out For A Deadly Space Walk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock helmets and gear as you progress through the game to personalize your team. In space no one can hear you scream, but they can see your questionable fashion choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/e84fd9f92f744e02d48b14aca99f1510.poster.avif?t=1770389064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/e84fd9f92f744e02d48b14aca99f1510.webm?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/e84fd9f92f744e02d48b14aca99f1510.mp4?t=1770389064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-based Single Player Campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 Players Multiplayer Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different level elements including: destructible planets, suns, black holes, electric shields, mines, asteroids, wormholes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapon types including: bazooka, cluster, repeater, triple shot, mines, meteor strikes, nukes, drills, rovers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of unlockable helmets and gear</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944610?t=1770389064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/722c82d18dcb6adb6bf1ec310544f6c756381896/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770389064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/7b721ea2c3a269b2a42e70913ff7020027a9982f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770389064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/7b721ea2c3a269b2a42e70913ff7020027a9982f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770389064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4376520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Is Your Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the force of gravity to aim your shots around planets and asteroids. Destructible planets take damage as your missiles crash into them. Take turns battling until only one team remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/af79ab78b9e0a11f092ad558603d2a36.poster.avif?t=1770389064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944610/extras/af79ab78b9e0a11f092ad558603d2a36.webm?t=17703